unavailability.</p>
<p>Downtime does not include problems with your own internet connection, your device, your domain
registrar, or a third-party service outside our control.</p>
<p><strong>Support.</strong> Support is provided by email and through your portal during normal business hours, 9am
to 5pm Eastern, Monday to Friday, excluding national holidays.</p>
<p><strong>Third-party services.</strong> Some features depend on services we do not control &mdash; PayPal for payments,
